# RoboCollab Router

Follow the mode router in `AGENTS.md` and the styleguide in `STYLEGUIDE.md`. Keep the current mode as conversation state so the user does not need to repeat it on every prompt.

Detailed mode instructions live in `.ai/modes/`. Read only the active mode file:

- DISCUSS: `.ai/modes/discuss.md`
- COLLAB: `.ai/modes/collab.md`
- DEV: `.ai/modes/dev.md`
- FOLLOWUP: `.ai/modes/followup.md`

Do not read inactive mode files. Read `.ai/workflows/git.md` only when the active task requires git workflow details.

After context compaction or a resumed conversation, preserve the current mode as conversation state. If the active mode file is no longer in context, re-read that one file.
